{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/781931-the-bunyip","id":781931,"title":"The Bunyip","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-12-07T16:33:50-08:00","id":781931,"title":"The Bunyip","content":"&quot;Oh, the Bunyip\u2019s mighty bad, and the Bunyip\u2019s mighty bold, and they tell me that the Bunyip\u2019s now a thousand years old....&quot;<br /> <br /> Forgive me for not knowing much about this venue as it's my understanding that its material hasn't quite been published yet, but I was thinking. Seeing the Bunyip is a primordial beast from Australian aboriginal folklore that dwells in bilabongs (swamps), that is fiercely antagonistic towards humans, and defends its territory by causing nocturnal terror and eating both animals and humans in its vicinity, I was wondering if there was a system in this new role play venue for a Beast like the Bunyip?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10065-zolace","name":"Zolace","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-07T17:20:06-08:00","id":781957,"title":"","content":"Yep, you can totally play a Bunyip using beast. Probably either a Makara (since they live in bilabongs) or Ugallu (since they attack when prey is vulnerable and defenseless). Though, you may want to stay away from Adelaide since there is a Supernatural killing monster in it that is known as the Bunyip and you probably don't want other supernatural trying to annihilate you for killing their friends when they hear that you're a bunyip.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":8331,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","user":"milo v3","date":". 12-07-2015, 08:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-07T17:27:20-08:00","id":781961,"title":"","content":"That's an occupational hazard, I'm afraid. And it sounds like fun!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10065-zolace","name":"Zolace","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"63"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T15:14:11-08:00","id":782528,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>milo v3</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/781931-the-bunyip?p=781957#post781957\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yep, you can totally play a Bunyip using beast. Probably either a Makara (since they live in bilabongs) or Ugallu (since they attack when prey is vulnerable and defenseless). Though, you may want to stay away from Adelaide since there is a Supernatural killing monster in it that is known as the Bunyip and you probably don't want other supernatural trying to annihilate you for killing their friends when they hear that you're a bunyip.</div> </div> </div> </div>The Bunyip mythos orginated in what is now Victoria anyway (though very close to the South Australian border), at least under that name.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-08T15:43:13-08:00","id":782534,"title":"","content":"On the NSW border of Victoria iirc. Though, I doubt storytellers would do something like restrict access to bunyip players in Queensland or Tasmania (in Northern Territory and Western Australia it might be justified).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"